OL,3,A'I lost my savings after a job
OL,4,Ainterview scam'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJobseekers are being warned to be
OL,7,Fvigilant as scammers are targeting
OL,8,Fpeople on job listings websites to
OL,9,Ftrick them into downloading bogus
OL,10,Finterview tools.
OL,12,FOne victim was invited on LinkedIn by a
OL,13,Ffake recruiter to take part in a job
OL,14,Finterview process and downloaded a
OL,15,Fnormal-looking document which turned
OL,16,Fout to be malicious software.
OL,18,FWithin hours the hackers had drained
OL,19,Fhis cryptocurrency accounts of #18,000
OL,20,Fof savings and disappeared.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
