OL,3,AThe next James Bond: The (00)7
OL,4,Aquestions fans want answered
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Bond is special. Playing him
OL,7,Fpropels an actor into an exceptionally
OL,8,Felite group of performers. From Sean
OL,9,FConnery to Daniel Craig, only six
OL,10,Fpeople have ever played him in the
OL,11,Fofficial film series.
OL,13,FIn the last decade alone the UK has had
OL,14,Fmore prime ministers, and twice as many
OL,15,Fpeople have walked on the moon than
OL,16,Fhave played the British secret agent.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788695310
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThe next James Bond: The (00)7
OL,4,Aquestions fans want answered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last announcement of a new Bond was
OL,7,F21 years ago in 2005. So it's
OL,8,Finevitable for Bond fans to want to
OL,9,Fhave their questions answered about the
OL,10,Ffuture of one of cinema's most sought
OL,11,Fafter roles, in one of cinema's biggest
OL,12,Ffranchises.
OL,14,FThis is, of course, the big question
OL,15,Ffans have been talking about for the
OL,16,Flast six years. And with an
OL,17,Fannouncement edging closer and closer,
OL,18,Fthe speculation has intensified
OL,19,Frecently.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
